# Lab Architecture

## Overview

This document describes the infrastructure used for the Wazuh cybersecurity homelab.

The environment is designed as an isolated virtual laboratory for learning security monitoring, log analysis and incident investigation.

## Infrastructure

| Component           | Details                 |
| ------------------- | ----------------------- |
| Wazuh Server        | TBD                     |
| Operating System    | Ubuntu Server 22.04 LTS |
| Virtualization      | Virtual Machine         |
| Wazuh Indexer       | Enabled                 |
| Wazuh Dashboard     | Enabled                 |
| Monitored Endpoints | TBD                     |

## Network

The laboratory uses a controlled local network environment.

## Security Considerations

No public IP addresses, credentials, API keys, tokens or other sensitive information are stored in this repository.
